Description: Tools for making directional claims about many parameters from
    posterior draws. A prior-odds threshold for the probability of direction
    accounts for multiplicity: a claim is made only if it holds under
    every prior in a class that lowers the prior odds of either direction,
    which raises the threshold that the probability of direction must reach.
    Joint posterior probabilities of sets of directional claims and
    simultaneous credible intervals are also provided.
